data: {"type": "message.updated", "sequence": 988, "run_id": "run_caff408c4d634db7", "data": {"id": "41aa1df4-06e2-460a-8922-75587f4aa6ae", "run_id": "run_caff408c4d634db7", "kind": "text", "position": 987, "revision": 988, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "agent_call_id": null, "data": {"text": "Validation passes: `passed: true`, 0 errors, 0 warnings. All 4 findings have resolvable analysis sources and result evidence.\n\n## Summary of all fixes applied\n\n| Issue | Fix |\n|---|---|\n| **1. Buggy LOO** | Rewrote `robustness.py` with per-iteration `best_diff` reset; corrected range from [2.70, 2.75]"}, "created_at": "2026-10-16T09:34:29.902267+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-16T09:34:30.437745+00:00"}}

id: 989
event: message.updated
data: {"type": "message.updated", "sequence": 989, "run_id": "run_caff408c4d634db7", "data": {"id": "41aa1df4-06e2-460a-8922-75587f4aa6ae", "run_id": "run_caff408c4d634db7", "kind": "text", "position": 987, "revision": 989, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "agent_call_id": null, "data": {"text": "Validation passes: `passed: true`, 0 errors, 0 warnings. All 4 findings have resolvable analysis sources and result evidence.\n\n## Summary of all fixes applied\n\n| Issue | Fix |\n|---|---|\n| **1. Buggy LOO** | Rewrote `robustness.py` with per-iteration `best_diff` reset; corrected range from [2.70, 2.75] to [3.90, 3.95]; Result.md updated accordingly |\n| **2. Missing exponential** | Persisted exponential fit params (a=0.133, b=1.27, R²=0.951) and Workplace15 exponential (a=0.156, b=2.04, R²=0.977) to `robustness_checks.json`; Result.md cites them |\n| **3. Finding 2 counts** | Corrected \"8 of"}, "created_at": "2026-10-16T09:34:29.902267+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-16T09:34:30.955568+00:00"}}

id: 990
event: message.updated
data: {"type": "message.updated", "sequence": 990, "run_id": "run_caff408c4d634db7", "data": {"id": "41aa1df4-06e2-460a-8922-75587f4aa6ae", "run_id": "run_caff408c4d634db7", "kind": "text", "position": 987, "revision": 990, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "agent_call_id": null, "data": {"text": "Validation passes: `passed: true`, 0 errors, 0 warnings. All 4 findings have resolvable analysis sources and result evidence.\n\n## Summary of all fixes applied\n\n| Issue | Fix |\n|---|---|\n| **1. Buggy LOO** | Rewrote `robustness.py` with per-iteration `best_diff` reset; corrected range from [2.70, 2.75] to [3.90, 3.95]; Result.md updated accordingly |\n| **2. Missing exponential** | Persisted exponential fit params (a=0.133, b=1.27, R²=0.951) and Workplace15 exponential (a=0.156, b=2.04, R²=0.977) to `robustness_checks.json`; Result.md cites them |\n| **3. Finding 2 counts** | Corrected \"8 of 10 > 0.999\" → \"7 of 10\"; removed \"geometric progression\" claim; added exact scale ratios (0.42, 0.67, 1.00) |\n| **4. Axis mismatch** |"}, "created_at": "2026-10-16T09:34:29.902267+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-16T09:34:31.468371+00:00"}}

id: 991
event: message.updated
data: {"type": "message.updated", "sequence": 991, "run_id": "run_caff408c4d634db7", "data": {"id": "41aa1df4-06e2-460a-8922-75587f4aa6ae", "run_id": "run_caff408c4d634db7", "kind": "text", "position": 987, "revision": 991, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "agent_call_id": null, "data": {"text": "Validation passes: `passed: true`, 0 errors, 0 warnings. All 4 findings have resolvable analysis sources and result evidence.\n\n## Summary of all fixes applied\n\n| Issue | Fix |\n|---|---|\n| **1. Buggy LOO** | Rewrote `robustness.py` with per-iteration `best_diff` reset; corrected range from [2.70, 2.75] to [3.90, 3.95]; Result.md updated accordingly |\n| **2. Missing exponential** | Persisted exponential fit params (a=0.133, b=1.27, R²=0.951) and Workplace15 exponential (a=0.156, b=2.04, R²=0.977) to `robustness_checks.json`; Result.md cites them |\n| **3. Finding 2 counts** | Corrected \"8 of 10 > 0.999\" → \"7 of 10\"; removed \"geometric progression\" claim; added exact scale ratios (0.42, 0.67, 1.00) |\n| **4. Axis mismatch** | Added `predictor_axis` field to both networks in JSON; Result.md explicitly discloses linear vs log axis difference and warns against direct slope comparison |\n| **5. Independent evidence uncited** | Added \"Independent Verification"}, "created_at": "2026-10-16T09:34:29.902267+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-16T09:34:31.994144+00:00"}}

id: 994
event: message.updated
data: {"type": "message.updated", "sequence": 994, "run_id": "run_caff408c4d634db7", "data": {"id": "41aa1df4-06e2-460a-8922-75587f4aa6ae", "run_id": "run_caff408c4d634db7", "kind": "text", "position": 987, "revision": 994, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "agent_call_id": null, "data": {"text": "Validation passes: `passed: true`, 0 errors, 0 warnings. All 4 findings have resolvable analysis sources and result evidence.\n\n## Summary of all fixes applied\n\n| Issue | Fix |\n|---|---|\n| **1. Buggy LOO** | Rewrote `robustness.py` with per-iteration `best_diff` reset; corrected range from [2.70, 2.75] to [3.90, 3.95]; Result.md updated accordingly |\n| **2. Missing exponential** | Persisted exponential fit params (a=0.133, b=1.27, R²=0.951) and Workplace15 exponential (a=0.156, b=2.04, R²=0.977) to `robustness_checks.json`; Result.md cites them |\n| **3. Finding 2 counts** | Corrected \"8 of 10 > 0.999\" → \"7 of 10\"; removed \"geometric progression\" claim; added exact scale ratios (0.42, 0.67, 1.00) |\n| **4. Axis mismatch** | Added `predictor_axis` field to both networks in JSON; Result.md explicitly discloses linear vs log axis difference and warns against direct slope comparison |\n| **5. Independent evidence uncited** | Added \"Independent Verification\" section in Result.md with actual numeric differences table |\n| **6. No clean reproduction** | Executed clean reproduction at `[workspace]`; all 7 artifacts produced and verified identical; documented in `reproduce.md` |\n| **7. Delegation timing** | Noted for record in analysis state; did not affect scientific results |\n| **8. p-value precision** | Corrected Workplace15 p-value to 1.95 × 10⁻¹⁵ (not below 10⁻¹⁵) |"}, "created_at": "2026-10-16T09:34:29.902267+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-16T09:34:32.851273+00:00"}}

